  "notes": "Views identified as front view looking along the part axis and section A-A through the axis/selected holes. Model is a stepped revolved flange: OD 76 flange, rear OD 48 boss, overall axial length 26, central through bore Ø28 with front counterbore Ø38 x 16 deep and R2 internal corner. Four axial counterbored bolt holes are on Ø56 bolt circle at 90 degree spacing; pilot Ø5.3 through the 18 mm flange thickness with Ø7.8 counterbore 4 deep from the front face. Drawing also shows a radial/cross drilled Ø5 passage located 7 mm from the front face and at 30 degrees in the front view, opening from the outside diameter into the central counterbore; this radial hole is not directly representable in the revolved PartSpec geometry/holes schema and is recorded here for review. No title-block tolerances shown; provisional ±0.1 mm used for linear/diameter dimensions and ±0.5 deg for the angular callout."
